"index":345,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":23,"end":150,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o068","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-a3ef184ac0e374dc2457","layer":"original","quote":"凤皇元年，西陵督步阐据城以叛〖1〗，遣使降晋。抗闻之日，部分诸军，令将军左奕、吾彦、蔡贡等径赴西陵。敕军营：更筑严围〖2〗，自赤溪至故市〖3〗；内以围阐，外以御寇。昼夜催切，如敌已至，众甚苦之。诸将咸谏曰：“今及三军之锐，亟以攻阐〖4〗；比晋救至〖5〗，阐必可拔。何事于围〖6〗，而以弊士民之力乎？”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":345,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":150,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-60e9fb9c8e564cf69651","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-fb457b5b5af0ee8e8487","layer":"pei","quote":"王濬治船于蜀。吾彦取其流7以呈孙皓，曰：‘晋必有攻吴之计，宜增建平兵。建平不下，终不敢渡江。’皓弗从","attribution":"裴注·晋纪","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":555,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-dc9d0fd53bc57fda2f6d","start":312,"end":362,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
